Christian Hofstede <chofstede@online.de> writes:

> I try to setup X11 Version on my machine...but i got the problem, that
> Nethack always uses Tiles but i don't want tiles.. I want my X11 nethack

You probably have 
NetHack.tile_file: x11tiles
defined in either /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/app-defaults/Nethack or in .Xdefaults
in your home directory. Comment it out, and you should see the X11
interface without tiles.

